<http://example.org/movie#film_Q108470887> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Dedh Bigha Zameen is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language drama film written and directed by Pulkit and produced by Karma Media And Entertainment. The film features Pratik Gandhi and Khushali Kumar in the lead roles. The film premiered on JioCinema on 31 May 2024." .
