<http://example.org/movie#film_Q129485963> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Frendo is a 2024 Gujarati comedy drama, directed and written by Vipul Sharma. It stars Tushar Sadhu, Twinkal Patel, Jay Pandya, Kushal Mistry, Deep Vaidya, Om Bhatt in leading role. The film is produced by Dr Bansari Patel, Raju Radia along with co produced by Dr. Jayesh Patel, Nikhil Raikundalia and Dr. Pooja Jainish Vashi, under the banner of Veer Bansari Films. The film will be distributed by Rupam Entertainment Pvt Ltd." .
