<http://example.org/movie#film_Q131752943> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Christmas in Lagos is a 2024 Nigerian romantic comedy-drama film written and directed by Jadesola Osiberu. Produced by Greoh Studios, the film explores the vibrant culture of Lagos, Nigeria, during the Christmas season. It features a mix of humor, romance, and family drama and captures the essence of celebrating Christmas in the bustling city. cast members include Richard Mofe-Damijo, Teniola Aladese, Shaffy Bello, Ladipoe, Shalom C. Obiago, Rayxia Ojo, Ebele Okaro-Onyiuke, and Ejike Asiegbu." .
