<http://example.org/movie#film_Q126189094> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Bujji at Anupatti is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language drama film written and directed by Raam Kandasamy. The film stars Karthik Vijay and Lavanya Kanmani in the lead roles. The film was produced by Raam Kandasamy under the banner of Kavilayaa Creations, and had a theatrical release on 31 May 2024." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q111213921> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Ghudchadi is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language romantic comedy film directed by Binoy Gandhi and written by Deepak Kapur Bhardwaj. Produced by Nidhi Dutta, Binoy Gandhi, Bhushan Kumar and Krishan Kumar under the banner of Keep Dreaming Pictures and T-Series. A remake of the blockbuster Bengali film Projapati (2022), it stars Sanjay Dutt and Raveena Tandon with Parth Samthaan, Khushalii Kumar and Aruna Irani in pivotal roles.The film was premiered on JioCinema on 9 August 2024." .
