<http://example.org/movie#film_Q96378044> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "The Fire Inside is a 2024 American biographical sports drama film by Rachel Morrison in her feature directorial debut. The film is about the early boxing career of Claressa \"T-Rex\" Shields, a fighter from Flint, Michigan, including her competing at the 2012 Summer Olympics. Ryan Destiny stars as Shields, alongside Brian Tyree Henry and Adam Clark." .
