<http://example.org/movie#film_Q130526069> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Corina is a 2024 Mexican comedy-drama film co-written, co-produced and directed by Urzula Barba Hopfner in her directorial debut. It stars Naian González Norvind and Cristo Fernández. It is about a woman with agoraphobia who must overcome her fears to search for a mysterious writer who will save her job." .
