<http://example.org/movie#film_Q126086650> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Barah x Barah (transl. 12x12) is a 2024 Indian Hindi-language film directed by Gaurav Madan. It stars Gyanendra Tripathi, Geetika Vidya Ohlyan, Bhumika Dube. The movie depicts life in Varanasi, one of India's oldest cities as it undergoes gradual changes." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q130367880> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Black is a 2024 Indian Tamil-language science fiction horror thriller film directed by KG Balasubramani in his directoral debut and it is produced by Potential Studios. The film stars Jiiva and Priya Bhavani Shankar in the lead roles, alongside Vivek Prasanna, Yog Japee and Swayam Siddha. It is an adaptation of the 2013 American film Coherence, directed by James Ward Byrkit. The film follows newlyweds Vasanth and Aranya who goes on a vacation but realize they are stuck in a worm hole which changes timeline each time they pass it." .
