<http://example.org/movie#film_Q115812586> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Baghjan is 2024 Assamese-Moran bilingual film directed and written by filmmaker Jaicheng Jai Dohutia and produced by MAYAMARA art & culture. The film is about the biggest industrial disasters; oil-leakage tragedy of 2020 at Baghjan." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q118434235> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Bonjour Tristesse is a 2024 coming-of-age romantic drama film written and directed by Durga Chew-Bose in her feature-length directorial debut, based on the 1954 novel by Françoise Sagan. It stars Lily McInerny, Claes Bang, Nailia Harzoune, Aliocha Schneider, and Chloë Sevigny. It is the second film adaptation of the novel, after the 1958 version directed by Otto Preminger, starring Deborah Kerr, David Niven, and Jean Seberg." .
