<http://example.org/movie#film_Q127506491> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "G for Gap is a 2024 Chinese comedy-drama film directed by Long Fei. It follows Wu Di, who returns to his hometown disheartened after years of failure in Beijing, only to face more struggles until an unexpected reunion with his high school classmate Feng Liuliu changes his life. The film premiered at the 14th Beijing International Film Festival on 19 April 2024, and was theatrically released on 8 June 2024." .
