<http://example.org/movie#film_Q129642052> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Gharjwai is a 2024 Nepali social drama film directed by Anil Budha Magar. Magar alongside Binod Khatiwada and Subash Koirala wrote the screenplay for the film. It's produced by Janak Gharti Magar under the banner of GM Movies Production. The film stars Dayahang Rai and Miruna Magar in lead roles with Shishir Bangdel, Raj Thapa Magar, Kabita Ale Magar and Buddhi Tamang in supporting roles." .
