<http://example.org/movie#film_Q124422250> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Gauraiya Live is a 2024 Hindi-language drama film directed by Gabriel Vats and produced by Rahul Rangare, Dr. Nishant Jain, Rohit Raj Singh Chouhan and Rajeev Jain under the banner of Rare Films and Tea and Poetry Films. The film stars Ada Singh, Omkar Das Manikpuri, Pankaj Jha. It is based on true events and is set against the backdrop of Bhopal." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q108456460> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Bharatha Puzha is a 2024 Indian Malayalam-language drama film written and directed by Manilal. It tells the story of Sugandhi, a sex worker who attempts to navigate through the social mores of life around her. Her journeys transgress gender and class divisions, and explore relationships." .
