<http://example.org/movie#film_Q124540259> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Chabuca is a 2024 Peruvian biographical drama film directed by Jorge Carmona and written by Christopher Vazquez, Mariana Silva and Ítalo Cordano. It is based on the life of Peruvian actor and drag queen Ernesto Pimentel 'Chola Chabuca'. It stars Sergio Armasgo accompanied by Haydeé Cáceres, Norka Ramirez, Miguel Dávalos, Izan Alcázar, Gina Yangali, Brando Gallessi, Alejandro Villagomez, Gerson Del Carpio and Erick Elera. Its premiered on April 11, 2024, in Peruvian theaters." .
