<http://example.org/movie#film_Q115804877> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Freaky Tales is a 2024 American anthology action comedy film written and directed by Anna Boden and Ryan Fleck. The film stars Pedro Pascal, Boden and Fleck's longtime collaborator Ben Mendelsohn, Jay Ellis, singer Normani in her film debut, Dominique Thorne, and Jack Champion." .
<http://example.org/movie#entity_tom_gormican> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tom Gormican" .
