<http://example.org/movie#film_Q115707860> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Cash Out is a 2024 American action film directed by Ives, written by Dipo Oseni and Doug Richardson, and starring John Travolta, Kristin Davis, Lukas Haas, and Quavo." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q136339272> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Circo is a Canadian documentary film, directed by Lamia Chraibi and released in 2024. The film is a portrait of Richard, a queer Brazilian circus performer who turns to drag to support himself after his adoptive mother kicks him out of her home." .
