<http://example.org/movie#film_Q130235383> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "¡Casa Bonita Mi Amor! is a 2024 American documentary film directed by Arthur Bradford. It is about Trey Parker and Matt Stone buying Casa Bonita, a Mexican restaurant in Colorado that was a prominent setting in a 2003 South Park episode titled \"Casa Bonita\". Parker and Stone spend over $30 million of their own money renovating the decaying restaurant, far over their original $6.5 million budget." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q124324096> <http://example.org/movie#hasCountry> <http://example.org/movie#entity_luxembourg> .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q133849164> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Bribe, Inc. is a 2024 documentary film which explores the corrupt practices of the Monaco-based company Unaoil, run by the Ahsani family. According to the film it conducted an \"industrial scale bribery operation\" for large corporations looking to win government projects in oil-rich nations. The film was directed by Peter W. Klein." .
