<http://example.org/movie#film_Q138456459> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Cup is a 2024 Indian Malayalam-language sports drama film directed by Sanju V Samuel. The film stars Mathew Thomas, Basil Joseph, Guru Somasundaram, and Riya Shibu in prominent roles. Set against the backdrop of competitive badminton, the film explores ambition, mentorship, and the pressures faced by young athletes. The film was released theatrically on 27 September 2024." .
