<http://example.org/movie#film_Q131985823> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Friendly Fire is a 2024 Philippine sports drama film written by Nikolas Red and Anton Santamaria and directed by Mikhail Red. It stars Loisa Andalio, Coleen Garcia, Yves Flores, Harvey Bautista and Bob Jbeili. The film is about an avid gamer, who is trying her level best to make it her profession." .
