<http://example.org/movie#film_Q123284951> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Damaged is a 2024 crime thriller film directed by Terry McDonough and starring Samuel L. Jackson, Vincent Cassel and Gianni Capaldi. It follows Chicago-based detective Dan Lawson (Jackson) who investigates a string of serial killings in Scotland alongside another detective, Walker Bravo (Cassel). As the case continues, Lawson discovers a pattern similar to another killing spree he handled five years prior." .
