<http://example.org/movie#film_Q125256467> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "First Shift is a 2024 American crime drama film produced, written, and directed by the German filmmaker Uwe Boll. It stars Gino Anthony Pesi as a lone NYPD officer who is forced to team up with a new recruit, played by Kristen Renton, on his next duty dealing with violent crimes in New York City. James McMenamin, Willy C. Carpenter, Brandi Bravo, and Daniel Sauli are featured in supporting roles." .
