<http://example.org/movie#film_Q131289313> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Buffalo Travels is a 2024 Sri Lankan Sinhalese comedy film directed and produced by Damith Fonseka in his directorial debut for Dream Films. It stars Bandu Samarasinghe in the lead role, where Mahendra Perera, Veena Jayakody, Damith Fonseka and Dilukshi Weerapperuma made supportive roles. George Glendorf, who is a Dutch actor played a main role for the first time in Sri Lankan cinema." .
