<http://example.org/movie#film_Q132774519> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Art Spiegelman: Disaster Is My Muse is a 2024 American documentary film about the cartoonist Art Spiegelman. It is produced and directed by Molly Bernstein and Philip Dolin. It premiered at DOC NYC in November 2024. It was given a limited theatrical release on February 21, 2025, and aired on PBS on April 15, 2025, as part of the American Masters series." .
