<http://example.org/movie#film_Q124714594> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Geethanjali Malli Vachindi is a 2024 Indian Telugu-language comedy horror film directed by debutant Siva Thurlapati. Produced by Kona Venkat and M. V. V. Satyanarayana through Kona Film Corporation and MVV Cinema respectively, the film stars Anjali, Srinivasa Reddy, Sunil, Satyam Rajesh, Shakalaka Shankar, Satya, and Rahul Madhav in lead roles. It is a sequel to the 2014 film Geethanjali. The film was released on 11 April 2024." .
