<http://example.org/movie#film_Q117842560> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Dear Santa is a 2024 American Christmas dark fantasy comedy film directed by Bobby Farrelly, written by Ricky Blitt and Peter Farrelly from a story by Ricky Blitt, Peter Farrelly, and Dan Ewen. Starring Jack Black, Keegan-Michael Key, Robert Timothy Smith, Brianne Howey, Hayes MacArthur, Post Malone, and P. J. Byrne. It tells the story of a dyslexic and meek sixth-grader who writes a Christmas list to Santa Claus to help with his problems, only for his misspelling to lead to him meeting what appears to be Satan, who decides to pose as the benevolent Christmas figure and offers the boy three wishes in exchange for his soul." .
