<http://example.org/movie#film_Q125793680> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Block Pass is a French drama film, directed by Antoine Chevrollier and released in 2024. The film stars Amaury Foucher as Jojo, a teenager living in Longué-Jumelles who is training as a motocross racer, and Sayyid El Alami as Willy, his longtime best friend whose support and loyalty prove critical to Jojo's survival after he is outed to the community as gay." .
