<http://example.org/movie#film_Q125559259> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Filmlovers! is a 2024 docufiction drama film written and directed by Arnaud Desplechin. It stars Milo Machado-Graner, Mathieu Amalric and Françoise Lebrun. It features the character of Paul Dédalus, who appeared in Desplechin's earlier films My Sex Life... or How I Got into an Argument (1996), A Christmas Tale (2008) and My Golden Days (2015). According to Desplechin the film is meant to \"celebrate movie theaters and their manifold magic\"." .
