<http://example.org/movie#film_Q126478657> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Bougainvillea is a 2024 Indian Malayalam-language psychological horror film directed by Amal Neerad, who co-wrote the script with Lajo Jose. It is jointly produced by Amal Neerad Productions and Udaya Pictures. The film stars Jyothirmayi, Kunchacko Boban and Fahadh Faasil in the lead roles alongside Veena Nandakumar, Srinda and Sharaf U Dheen in supporting roles. It was inspired by Lajo Jose's novel Ruthinte Lokam (2019) and marks Jyothirmayi's comeback to cinema after an 11-year hiatus." .
