<http://example.org/movie#film_Q131143577> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "Breathing Underwater is a 2024 Luxembourgish drama film co-written and directed by Eric Lamhène. The film is an emotional, character-driven drama set in the secretive world of a women's shelter. The film had its world premiere at the Warsaw Film Festival on 12 October 2024. It competed in the 1-2 Competition section." .
<http://example.org/movie#film_Q124426106> <http://example.org/movie#sourceSummary> "The Damned is a 2024 folk horror film directed by Thordur Palsson and written by Jamie Hannigan, who adapted the screenplay from a story by Palsson. It stars Odessa Young as a 19th-century widow who faces an agonizing decision after a shipwreck threatens to fully deplete her village's scarce supplies during a harsh winter. The cast also includes Joe Cole, Rory McCann, Lewis Gribben, and Turlough Convery." .
